        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho, Amurafeli mfalume wa Shinari, Arioko mfalume wa Elasari, Kedorilaoma mfalume wa Elamu na Tidali mfalume wa Goimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "apigana viha na afalume atsano, Bera mfalume wa Sodoma, Birisha mfalume wa Gomora, Shinabu mfalume wa Adima, Shemeberi mfalume wa Seboimu, na mfalume wa Bela ambayo piya yaihwa Soari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano afalume atsano ahala asikari aho a viha na achiahenda kundi mwenga hiko Dete ra Sidimu, ambaro vivi ni Bahari ya Munyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa miaka kumi na miiri alazimishwa kuhumikira mfalume Kedorilaoma ela mwaka wa kumi na tahu achimuasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa kumi na ne Kedorilaoma na hara afalume ayae akpwedzaapiga Arafa hiko Ashiterothi-Karinaimu, Azuzi hiko Hamu, Aemi hiko Shawe-Kiriathaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ahori hiko mwango wa Seiri, achiazoresa hadi Eli-Parani kanda-kanda ya jangbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiuya nyuma hadi Eni-Mishipati (yani Kadeshi), achipiga na achihala tsi yosi ya Aamaleki na achiashinda Aamori ariokala Hazazoni-Tamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho afalume a Sodoma, Gomora, Adima, Seboimu na Bela (dzinare ranjina ni Soari) atuluka achendadzipanga ko Dete ra Sidimu. Ahenda vivi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili apigane na Kedorilaoma mfalume wa Elamu, Tidali mfalume wa Goimu, Amurafeli mfalume wa Shinari na Arioko mfalume wa Elasari, afalume atsano chinyume cha afalume a ne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dete ra Sidimu kala ri tele madibwa ga lami na afalume a Sodoma na Gomora na asikari aho phokala anachimbira viha, anjina agbwa mo madibwani, na hara anjina ariosala azorera myangoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara afalume ane ahala mali zosi za Sodoma na Gomora, piya vyakurya, na achiphiya vyao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lutu, mwana wa ndugungbwa wa Buramu, ambaye kala anasagala Sodoma, piya wahalwa mateka phamwenga na malize zosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu mmwenga yekala akachimbira, wakpwendamuambira Buramu, Mueburania kuhusu gosi gokala gakahendeka kuko. Wakati uho Buramu kala anasagala phephi na mihi ya mialoni ya Mamre, yuya Muamori, ndugungbwa wa Eshikoli na Aneri, osi ambao kala akaphahana na Buramu kuteryana siku za shida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buramu ariphophaha habari kukala mwanawe akahalwa kpwa nguvu, wahala alume osi magana mahahu na kumi na nane a phakpwe kambini okala anaweza kuphiya vihani na achialunga-lunga hara maadui hadi Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiko waaganya atue madiba-madiba; usiku achipigana na hara maadui na achiashinda. Achiazoresa hadi Hoba ambako ni uphande wa vurini wa mudzi wa Damasikasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiphaha mali zosi zokala zikahalwa zewe. Piya wamphaha Lutu mwana wa nduguye na achimuuyiza na malize, phamwenga na alume na achetu anjina ambao kala akatsamizwa kpwa lazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buramu ariphouya kula vihani ambako washinda mfalume Kedorilaoma na afalume ayae, mfalume wa Sodoma wakpwedzamchinjira Buramu Dete ra Shawe (yani Dete ra Mfalume).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
